      "explanation": "Crust thickness is exaggerated for readability. Depth bands are approximate teaching references. Mantle is predominantly solid and deforms over geological time. Outer core is liquid; inner core is solid. Tracer follows a prescribed schematic circulation field, not a geodynamic solver. One circulation cell does not alone drive a plate."
